  9   4010              ; WHERE IT BREAKS. A Graphic I page drawn by TEXT_PAGE (R#3 = $80, R#4 = $00).
 10   4010              ; After 8 frames, M3: Graphic II, nothing else changed. After 8 more,
 11   4010              ; the fix: 2,048 colours written at $2000, R#3 = $9F and R#4 = $00, so that the
 12   4010              ; three thirds share the page's shapes, and each line of a name has a colour.
